#doc (Page) "Team" =>

Tau Ceti is a community project which anyone can contribute to.
You can help by writing and reviewing [roadmaps](https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCetiRoadmap), running the Tau Ceti worker with your inference,
or by donating to support the project (we'd be happy to have both inference and compute for CI).
All of the infrastructure is open and maintained by the community, and improvements there are very welcome.

See the [Statistics](statistics) page for details about who has been authoring contributions and running reviews. Get on those leaderboards!
Read the [contribution guide](https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti#contributing-with-the-worker-cli) for getting started.

