# Support

Tau Ceti is being incubated by the
[Mathlib Initiative](https://mathlib-initiative.org/) and the
[Lean FRO](https://lean-lang.org/fro/). Currently we're running on a shoestring, with CI costs covered by the Lean FRO.
We have a donation of $3m worth of inference (i.e. API credits) from Anthropic's AI for Science program.

We're actively preparing, with a wider team, a proposal for a sustainable funding model, and for scaling up.
Please [get in touch on Lean Zulip](https://leanprover.zulipchat.com/) if you'd like to support this program.
